<title>USA: PennCorp postpones shareholder merger vote.</title>
<headline>PennCorp postpones shareholder merger vote.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>PennCorp Financial Group said Friday it has postponed its special meeting of shareholders, scheduled for March 21. The meeting was called for shareholders to vote on the company's proposed merger with Washington National Corp.</p>
<p>A new date will be determined by PennCorp's board of directors, said the company.</p>
</text>
